+                + "Jane Doe: Promoting your podcast in a new\n\n"
+                + "2\n"
+                + "badstarttime --> badendtime\n"
+                + "way. The latest from PogNews.\n"
+                + "badstarttime -->\n"
+                + "Jane Doe says something\n"
+                + "00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,730\n"
+                + "Jane Doe:";
+        result = TranscriptParser.parse(srtStrBad2, type);
